[{"text": "And now I give the floor to his", "start": 1.199, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "excellency Jeffrey Hunley, Deputy Prime", "start": 3.439, "duration": 8.521}, {"text": "Minister of St. Kits and Navies.", "start": 7.04, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 30.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Secretary General,", "start": 33.44, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 36.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "distinguished delegates,", "start": 38.079, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "friends, and my fellow kitians and", "start": 40.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "divisions at home and throughout the", "start": 42.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "diaspora.", "start": 46.48, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "I bring greetings from the proud twin", "start": 48.399, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "federation", "start": 50.719, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "island of St. Kits and Nevis and our", "start": 52.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "prime minister", "start": 56.96, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "the honorable Dr. Terren Drew.", "start": 59.44, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Mr. President, we extend congratulations", "start": 63.68, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "on your elections as president of the", "start": 66.96, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "81st session of this assembly.", "start": 69.84, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "We also express sincere appreciation to", "start": 73.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "your predecessor for her stewardship", "start": 76.88, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "over the past year.", "start": 79.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "I rise before this assembly", "start": 83.119, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "at a time when the world is not short of", "start": 86.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "promises,", "start": 88.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "declarations or commitments.", "start": 90.32, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "What we need is proof that our", "start": 94.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "institutions", "start": 97.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "can respond to the realities people", "start": 99.04, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "face.", "start": 101.92, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "For small island developing states like", "start": 103.68, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "ours, the question is immediate.", "start": 106.64, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "St. Kit San", "start": 111.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "therefore comes with a clear", "start": 113.439, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "proposition.", "start": 116.0, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Trust will be restored not by what we", "start": 118.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "promise", "start": 122.159, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "but by what we deliver.", "start": 123.68, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "The time has come to move from promise", "start": 127.92, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "to proof.", "start": 131.28, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "I come not only to speak about what the", "start": 133.84, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "world must do but to account for what we", "start": 137.44, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "are doing.", "start": 142.16, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 144.72, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "last year our prime minister, the", "start": 146.72, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "honorable Dr. Terren Drew spoke of our", "start": 149.599, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "sustainable island state agenda CISA our", "start": 154.16, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "national blueprint for transforming St.", "start": 158.879, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Kitsanis", "start": 161.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "into a more resilient sustainable", "start": 162.959, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "inclusive and prosperous society by", "start": 167.04, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "2040.", "start": 171.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Today we return to demonstrate that it", "start": 173.519, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "is becoming a record of delivery.", "start": 177.28, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Earlier this year, our second voluntary", "start": 181.92, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "national review in the United Nations", "start": 185.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "high level political forum showed", "start": 188.239, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "stronger government coordination,", "start": 191.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "closer alignment with sustainable", "start": 194.159, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "development goals and tangible progress", "start": 196.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "for our people.", "start": 199.599, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Water provides one of the clearest", "start": 202.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "measures of that progress.", "start": 205.2, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "One year ago, our 2 milliongal per day", "start": 209.36, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "solar power dissalination plant was", "start": 213.519, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "nearing completion.", "start": 216.64, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "In February, we commissioned it. through", "start": 219.2, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "semi-airborne drone surveys. We are also", "start": 223.2, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "identified 17 new potential groundwater", "start": 227.36, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "sources and in August completed drilling", "start": 231.04, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "at the first rural site", "start": 235.44, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "together with distribution of grades.", "start": 239.04, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "These investments are strengthening", "start": 242.879, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "water security.", "start": 245.599, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "In 2022,", "start": 248.4, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "only 25% of our households had 247", "start": 250.64, "duration": 9.999}, {"text": "water. Today, approximately 75%", "start": 255.36, "duration": 10.32}, {"text": "do. This is transformation.", "start": 260.639, "duration": 8.241}, {"text": "On the island of NEAS,", "start": 265.68, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "we advancing a 30 megawatt geothermal", "start": 268.88, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "power development with drilling expected", "start": 271.919, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "by early 2027", "start": 276.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and Icelandic drillers contracted to", "start": 279.44, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "begin the process.", "start": 282.56, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "In St. kits. Plans for a 50 megawatt", "start": 285.84, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "solar PV and battery storage project are", "start": 290.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "well advanced.", "start": 293.44, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "These investments will reduce dependence", "start": 295.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "on imported fossil fuels and strengthen", "start": 298.639, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "economic resilience.", "start": 302.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "We are also strengthening food security", "start": 305.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "through climate smart support for", "start": 308.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "farmers and health care through our", "start": 310.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "locally developed national digital", "start": 312.88, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "health information system at the Joseph", "start": 315.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and France General Hospital.", "start": 318.4, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Sustainability", "start": 321.36, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "must be practical,", "start": 323.12, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "people centered and built to last.", "start": 325.52, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "Mr. President, there is more to do. But", "start": 330.16, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "our experience proves that small states", "start": 334.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "are not powerless.", "start": 337.759, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "With investment, partnership and", "start": 340.0, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "political will, small nations can", "start": 343.28, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "deliver big solutions.", "start": 346.479, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "St. Kits and Nevice is not seeking pity.", "start": 349.759, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "We are advancing partnership.", "start": 354.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "A sustainable island state is not a", "start": 356.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "distant ambition. We are building it", "start": 359.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "today.", "start": 363.44, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "Yet even as we advance, the climate", "start": 364.96, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "crisis is moving the goalpost. This", "start": 368.319, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "year, our federation and the wider", "start": 371.68, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Caribbean face severe drought. By the", "start": 374.319, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "end of May, rainfall was 44% below the", "start": 377.84, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "long-term average. We are investing in", "start": 382.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "resilient infrastructure.", "start": 386.4, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "But no small island developing state can", "start": 388.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "adapt indefinitely to a crisis the world", "start": 391.919, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "continues to intensify.", "start": 395.12, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Adaptation cannot excuse in action", "start": 398.319, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "elsewhere.", "start": 402.8, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Distinguished colleagues, the science is", "start": 404.72, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "unequivocal.", "start": 407.759, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "The years 2015 to 2025", "start": 409.52, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "were the warmest on record. And in 2025,", "start": 413.039, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "global average temperature remained", "start": 417.759, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "about 1.43\u00b0", "start": 420.24, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "C above the pre-industrial baseline,", "start": 422.319, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "while global mean sea level stood", "start": 425.919, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "approximately 11 cm higher than in 1993.", "start": 428.8, "duration": 9.519}, {"text": "For island nations, this is a question", "start": 435.039, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "of sovereignty and statethood.", "start": 438.319, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "If our coastlines retreat,", "start": 442.319, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "our sovereignty must not. Mr. President,", "start": 445.759, "duration": 8.641}, {"text": "climate induced sea level rise must", "start": 451.199, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "never erase a state's international", "start": 454.4, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "legal personality,", "start": 456.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "extinguish its UN membership, deprive", "start": 459.44, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "its people of nationality, or diminish", "start": 462.72, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "lawfully established maritime zones of", "start": 466.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "sovereign rights.", "start": 469.44, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "The International Law Commission has", "start": 471.28, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "laid foundations for continuity of", "start": 473.919, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "statehood, sovereignty, maritime", "start": 476.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "entitlements.", "start": 481.039, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "This assembly must turn them into firm", "start": 482.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "guarantees.", "start": 487.12, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "International law has spoken with the", "start": 489.68, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "increasing clarity. St. Kitsanis", "start": 492.479, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "welcomed the international court of", "start": 495.759, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "justice advisory opinion on states", "start": 497.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "climate obligations.", "start": 501.12, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Clarification must now become", "start": 504.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "compliance.", "start": 506.879, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "Compliments must become conduct", "start": 508.72, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "and promises must become performance.", "start": 512.08, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "States must reduce emissions,", "start": 516.88, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "strengthen adaptation,", "start": 519.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "honor climate finance responsibilities,", "start": 522.399, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "and cooperate with countries bearing", "start": 525.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "consequences vastly disos", "start": 528.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "disproportionate", "start": 530.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "to their contribution to this crisis.", "start": 532.72, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "Mr. President, those contributions", "start": 537.519, "duration": 9.681}, {"text": "least must not pay the greatest price.", "start": 541.44, "duration": 9.44}, {"text": "Our oceans must also move from promises", "start": 547.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "to protection.", "start": 550.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "St. Kitsanis ratified the BBJ agreement", "start": 552.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "in 2025.", "start": 556.48, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Implementation now matters.", "start": 558.72, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Large ocean states needs access to", "start": 561.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "capacity building marine technology,", "start": 564.64, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "scientific knowledge and financing.", "start": 568.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "While benefits for marine genetics", "start": 571.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "resources must be shared fairly", "start": 573.839, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "for us island nations,", "start": 578.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "the ocean is not the space between us", "start": 581.12, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "and the world. It is our highway,", "start": 584.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "heritage,", "start": 588.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "livelihood and lifeline.", "start": 589.68, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "Across climate action, sea level rise", "start": 593.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and ocean governance.", "start": 597.279, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "One reality remains. Resilience has a", "start": 599.6, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "cost. For decades, small island", "start": 604.0, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "developing states have argued that", "start": 607.519, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "income is not the same as resilience.", "start": 610.08, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "Mr. President per capita income cannot", "start": 614.64, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "show exposure to hurricanes, droughts,", "start": 618.24, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "pandemic, ship shipping disruptions,", "start": 621.92, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "energy shocks, conflict or tourist", "start": 625.519, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "collapse.", "start": 629.279, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "Nor how quickly one shock can erase", "start": 630.8, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "years of investment.", "start": 634.72, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "This year, St. Kets stood before the", "start": 638.8, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "United Nations and completed the pilot", "start": 642.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "vulnerability and resilient country", "start": 645.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "profile under the multi-dimensional", "start": 648.16, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "vulnerability index framework. And what", "start": 650.88, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "did we learn? We learned what our", "start": 654.64, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "grandparents always knew. A house can", "start": 657.839, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "look strong from the road and still have", "start": 661.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "rot in the rafters.", "start": 664.72, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Vulnerability is not a statistic.", "start": 667.92, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "It is a roof that was destroyed in", "start": 671.6, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "hurricane burial. It is a school that", "start": 673.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "became a shelter. It is a family", "start": 676.8, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "rebuilding for the third time in a", "start": 679.6, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "decade because storms have no patience", "start": 682.64, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "for GNI per capita.", "start": 686.959, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Mr. President, we are not asking that", "start": 690.079, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "gross national income be discarded.", "start": 692.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "We are asking that it stop being", "start": 696.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "expected to tell a story it was never", "start": 698.56, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "designed to tell. GNI can count our", "start": 702.88, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "coconuts and our cruise ships. It cannot", "start": 706.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "count our courage and it cannot count", "start": 710.64, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "the price we pay to simply remain.", "start": 713.519, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "It cannot capture the cost of rebuilding", "start": 718.72, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "the same bridge, clinic or seaw wall", "start": 722.24, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "again and again while nations twice our", "start": 726.56, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "size and half of of our vulnerability", "start": 730.079, "duration": 8.241}, {"text": "borrowed cheaper than we do. We", "start": 734.16, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "therefore call on the World Bank, the", "start": 738.32, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "IMF, development banks, climate funds,", "start": 741.36, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "and every partner here to incorporate", "start": 746.0, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "NVI into the architecture of financing,", "start": 749.12, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "not as charity, but as arithmetic and", "start": 753.76, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "justice made real. If vulnerability can", "start": 757.36, "duration": 10.279}, {"text": "be measured, it must be considered.", "start": 761.6, "duration": 6.039}, {"text": "Mr. President, the next great divide", "start": 769.44, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "between nations must not be digital.", "start": 772.56, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Artificial intelligence offers", "start": 777.12, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "extraordinary possibilities. St. Kit", "start": 779.44, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Sanas intends to participate, but we", "start": 782.48, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "must ask who will shape this new age and", "start": 786.8, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "who will live with decisions made", "start": 789.92, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "elsewhere.", "start": 793.2, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "At the end of 2025,", "start": 794.88, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "some 2.2 billion people remain offline.", "start": 797.36, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "But the AI divide also concern", "start": 801.92, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "computing, power, data, research,", "start": 805.04, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "skills, energy, cyber security, and", "start": 809.2, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "capital with the global the global AI", "start": 813.519, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "market projected to reach US $4.8 8", "start": 817.36, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "trillion by 2033.", "start": 821.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Developing countries cannot simply", "start": 825.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "consume technologies designed and", "start": 827.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "governed elsewhere.", "start": 830.56, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "We must have a place where AI's future", "start": 833.04, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "is decided. St. Kits welcomes the", "start": 836.639, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "independent international scientific", "start": 840.959, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "panel on artificial intelligence and the", "start": 843.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "global dialogue on AI governance.", "start": 846.399, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "Inclusion must lead to capability.", "start": 849.519, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "Developing countries need affordable", "start": 855.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "computing power, infrastructure,", "start": 858.24, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "skills and safeguard for privacy, data", "start": 861.44, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "sovereignty, cyber security and rights.", "start": 865.04, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "Mr. President, at home we are advancing", "start": 870.24, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "a whole of government technological", "start": 874.16, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "strategy securing digital identity and", "start": 876.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "digital public services.", "start": 880.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Regionally, the Caribbean AI Task Force", "start": 882.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "supports cooperation and governance,", "start": 886.639, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "innovation, and responsible adoption.", "start": 889.44, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "Mr. President, artificial intelligence", "start": 894.0, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "is already transforming the world. St.", "start": 897.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Kits", "start": 900.72, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "chooses to help shape that", "start": 902.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "transformation.", "start": 905.279, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "As Sids, we know a simple truth. Alone", "start": 907.44, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "we are small. Together we are", "start": 911.839, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "formidable. The Caribbean Declaration as", "start": 915.279, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "a zone of peace must retain its force as", "start": 918.48, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "geopolitical competition moves closer to", "start": 922.72, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "our shores.", "start": 926.56, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Our response must remain anchored in", "start": 929.199, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "sovereignty, territorial integrity,", "start": 933.44, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "international law, peaceful settlement", "start": 937.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "of disputes and diplomacy.", "start": 940.639, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Cariccom supports the international", "start": 944.32, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "court of justice as the lawful path for", "start": 946.959, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "resolving the Guyana Venezuela dispute", "start": 950.88, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "and the judicial process concerning Bise", "start": 954.8, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "and Guatemala. We defend international", "start": 958.399, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "law because for small states especially", "start": 962.079, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "the alternatives is a world where power", "start": 965.92, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "becomes the rule across Gaza, Ukraine,", "start": 969.44, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Sudan, Yemen, Chad and the Democratic", "start": 973.92, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "Republic of the Congo. Civilians", "start": 976.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "continue to bear an unconscionable", "start": 979.839, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "burden. St. Kitanis affirms one standard", "start": 982.399, "duration": 9.761}, {"text": "international law applied consistently", "start": 988.0, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "not selectively and conscience applied", "start": 992.16, "duration": 8.919}, {"text": "evenly not conveniently.", "start": 996.16, "duration": 4.919}, {"text": "There can be no hierarchy of human", "start": 1001.759, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "suffering. Mr. President the future of", "start": 1005.04, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 1008.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "also depends on its leadership.", "start": 1011.04, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "St. Kit Sanas proudly joins Caraccom in", "start": 1014.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "endorsing her excellency", "start": 1018.399, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Caroline Rodriguez Burket of Guyana for", "start": 1021.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "the office of the United Nations", "start": 1025.439, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Secretary General. Her understanding of", "start": 1027.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "the challenges facing developing nations", "start": 1030.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "reflect the leadership this moment", "start": 1032.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "demands. Her candidature as an", "start": 1035.76, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "indigenous woman from a small developing", "start": 1038.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "state also reaffirms that global", "start": 1041.439, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "leadership must be defined not by the", "start": 1044.72, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "size of a nation but by the vision,", "start": 1048.799, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "integrity and capacity of those called", "start": 1052.48, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "to serve.", "start": 1056.88, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "Mr. President, few bridges carry greater", "start": 1061.28, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "historical meaning or future potential", "start": 1064.64, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "than between Africa and the Caribbean.", "start": 1068.16, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "The Atlantic, once a passage of forced", "start": 1071.919, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "displacement and separation, is becoming", "start": 1075.84, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "a pathway of return and reconnection.", "start": 1078.96, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "Africa Caribbean cooperation must move", "start": 1083.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "beyond sentiment.", "start": 1086.799, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Our shared history must help build a", "start": 1089.36, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "shared future through capital, trade,", "start": 1092.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "technology,", "start": 1097.039, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "knowledge, culture and coordinated", "start": 1098.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "diplomacy.", "start": 1102.559, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Mr. President South South cooperation", "start": 1104.64, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "must be felt in jobs, businesses,", "start": 1108.72, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "knowledge transfer and opportunity.", "start": 1112.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "It complements, not replaces, north", "start": 1115.44, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "south cooperation and the obligations of", "start": 1119.2, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "developed country. Greater accuracy must", "start": 1122.48, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "also include justice. At the second", "start": 1126.799, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "African Caribbean submit, our leaders", "start": 1130.48, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "signed the Abi Adisa Baba Declaration.", "start": 1133.36, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "And this year, the African Union's", "start": 1138.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "reparation mechanism and the Caribbean", "start": 1141.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Reparations Commission held their first", "start": 1144.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "joint meeting establishing permanent", "start": 1146.88, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "coordination", "start": 1150.88, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "on", "start": 1153.84, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "on March 25th, 2026. This general", "start": 1155.679, "duration": 10.161}, {"text": "assembly adopted resolution 80 25 250", "start": 1159.919, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "declaring that trafficking of enslaved", "start": 1165.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "African and racialized chatel", "start": 1168.0, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "enslavement of Africans as the gravest", "start": 1170.72, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "crime against humanity. St. Kitanius", "start": 1174.32, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "welcomed this historic recognition. But", "start": 1178.0, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "recognition cannot be the destination.", "start": 1181.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Repatory justice must move from", "start": 1185.679, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "recognition to remedy and from words to", "start": 1188.16, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "action.", "start": 1192.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Distinguished colleagues, when we speak", "start": 1195.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "of repatory justice, sovereignty and", "start": 1198.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "solidarity,", "start": 1201.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Haiti cannot be an afterthought.", "start": 1203.12, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Approximately", "start": 1206.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "1.47 47 million people are eternally", "start": 1208.08, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "displaced while nearly half of the", "start": 1212.48, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "population faces acute food insecurity.", "start": 1215.28, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "In the very near future, the first round", "start": 1220.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "of presidential and legislative", "start": 1223.039, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "elections will take place. The Haitian", "start": 1225.44, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "people must choose their leaders freely,", "start": 1229.039, "duration": 9.201}, {"text": "credibly, and safely. Mr. President St.", "start": 1232.96, "duration": 9.68}, {"text": "Kit San joins CARICOM in calling for the", "start": 1238.24, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "full deployment of the United Nations", "start": 1242.64, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "authorized gang suppression force and", "start": 1245.679, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "the timely renewal of its mandate", "start": 1248.559, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "alongside Haitianled", "start": 1251.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "recovery and governance.", "start": 1254.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Mr. President, we remain deeply", "start": 1258.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "concerned about the humanitarian", "start": 1260.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "situation in Cuba. St. Kissan has", "start": 1262.88, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "contributed to humanitarian relief to", "start": 1266.64, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "the Cuman people and our own nationals", "start": 1269.52, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "studying there. We welcome the recent", "start": 1274.0, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "measures undertaken by the Cuban", "start": 1277.44, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "government to improve the well-being of", "start": 1280.159, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "its people and encourage further", "start": 1282.559, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "meaningful action. We urge constructive", "start": 1285.12, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "dialogue between the governments of Cuba", "start": 1288.96, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "and the United States.", "start": 1292.08, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "Engagement,", "start": 1294.799, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "mutual respect and cooperation offers a", "start": 1296.559, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "best path, improving the lives of the", "start": 1300.559, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "Cuban people and advancing peace and", "start": 1304.159, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "stability throughout our region.", "start": 1307.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Mr. President, St. Kitsanis remains", "start": 1311.36, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "steadfast in its friendship with the", "start": 1314.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Republic of China, Taiwan, and supports", "start": 1316.64, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "for its meaningful international", "start": 1319.52, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "participation.", "start": 1322.159, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "Earlier this year, we join our member", "start": 1323.919, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "states in requesting Taiwan's obser", "start": 1326.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "observer participation in the 79th World", "start": 1328.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Health Assembly. We continue to support", "start": 1332.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "its meaningful participation in the", "start": 1335.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "World Health Organization,", "start": 1338.48, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the International Civil Aviation", "start": 1340.72, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Organization,", "start": 1342.88, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "and other relevant mechanisms, and", "start": 1344.4, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "reiterate that differences across the", "start": 1347.2, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Taiwan Strait must be resolved", "start": 1350.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "peacefully.", "start": 1353.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Mr. President, no generation has a", "start": 1355.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "greater stake in our decisions than", "start": 1358.88, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "young people. Half of the world's", "start": 1362.08, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "population is under 30. Yet 67 million", "start": 1364.96, "duration": 9.52}, {"text": "young people were unemployed last year", "start": 1370.88, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "and more than a quarter of a billion", "start": 1374.48, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "were neither in employment, education", "start": 1377.039, "duration": 9.281}, {"text": "nor training. AI, the green transition", "start": 1380.799, "duration": 8.961}, {"text": "and climate change are reshaping their", "start": 1386.32, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "future jobs. We must prepare them. Last", "start": 1389.76, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "year, our prime minister introduced this", "start": 1394.96, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "assembly to our Aspire program.", "start": 1398.72, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Achieving success through personal", "start": 1402.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "investment, resources, and education for", "start": 1404.96, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "citizens aged 5 to 18.", "start": 1409.2, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Built on savings, investment, and", "start": 1412.88, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "financial education, Aspire has opened", "start": 1416.32, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "more than 4,000 savings accounts with", "start": 1420.159, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "our government committing more than US 2", "start": 1424.32, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "million to give children a financial", "start": 1428.0, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "foundation for adulthood.", "start": 1430.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "We are now piloting our financial", "start": 1433.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "education curriculum in schools and", "start": 1436.48, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "training teachers for national roll out.", "start": 1439.2, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "We are not simply giving children money.", "start": 1443.28, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "We are giving them the knowledge to make", "start": 1446.32, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "money work for them. Financial", "start": 1449.12, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "independence must not be reserved for", "start": 1452.32, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "those born into wealth.", "start": 1455.6, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "Finally, Mr. President, distinguished", "start": 1459.76, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "colleagues, for 81 years, this", "start": 1463.2, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "institution has represented a bold", "start": 1466.159, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "conviction", "start": 1469.679, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "that despite our differences,", "start": 1471.2, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "nations can come together across common", "start": 1474.24, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "rules, responsibilities,", "start": 1478.64, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and human dignity. That conviction is", "start": 1481.6, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "worth defending. But institutions cannot", "start": 1485.84, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "live indefinitely on those founding", "start": 1490.64, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "promises. They must be judged by what", "start": 1494.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "those promises produce.", "start": 1497.76, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "St. Kitsanius remains ready to do its", "start": 1501.44, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "part and to work with every nation here", "start": 1504.96, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "towards a more peaceful, sustainable,", "start": 1508.159, "duration": 8.801}, {"text": "equitable and humane world.", "start": 1512.64, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "Mr. President, trust is not something we", "start": 1516.96, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "can demand.", "start": 1520.96, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "It must be earned", "start": 1522.799, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "by promising less, delivering more, and", "start": 1525.679, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "letting the proof speak where our words", "start": 1529.679, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "once stood alone.", "start": 1533.76, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Let this assembly be remembered not for", "start": 1536.96, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "what was said here but for what was done", "start": 1541.2, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "after.", "start": 1545.52, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "The tide is rising.", "start": 1547.44, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "Let our resolve rise faster still. Thank", "start": 1551.039, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "you.", "start": 1555.679, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Thank you. I thank the deputy prime", "start": 1559.44, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "minister of St. Kits and Navies.", "start": 1562.0, "duration": 4.52}]